 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "nar_m13_line_op_missing_001",
   "loc_key": "nar_m13_line_op_missing_001",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m13_evt_operation_started",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "The erased census, the curated quiet, the shape beside us — they converge here. The missing are assembling, and nobody's record admits they exist.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 186,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m13_vo_op_missing_001",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m13_line_op_receipt_002",
   "loc_key": "nar_m13_line_op_receipt_002",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m13_evt_operation_started",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "So we build the admission. Paired readback at both public records, a Spine linked to the Crownfall index, and one observation receipt completed in the open.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 196,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m13_vo_op_receipt_002",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m13_line_op_witness_003",
   "loc_key": "nar_m13_line_op_witness_003",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m13_evt_operation_started",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "The verifier and I witness from separate sites. One pair of eyes is a claim. Two, apart, on the public record — that is a fact with structure.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 182,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m13_vo_op_witness_003",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m13_line_op_care_004",
   "loc_key": "nar_m13_line_op_care_004",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m13_evt_operation_started",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "We observe. We do not name, number, or claim the missing. The receipt records that an assembly was witnessed. It does not presume to say more.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 182,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m13_vo_op_care_004",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m13_line_readback_001",
   "loc_key": "nar_m13_line_readback_001",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m13_evt_readback_established",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "Paired readback established — Meridian record by me, Kharuun by the verifier. Both channels public, both live.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 150,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m13_vo_readback_001",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m13_line_readback_002",
   "loc_key": "nar_m13_line_readback_002",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m13_evt_readback_established",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "Now the Spine. An ordinary worker raises it within reach of the index. Ordinary hands, on purpose — this link should not need heroes to exist.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 182,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m13_vo_readback_002",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m13_line_linked_001",
   "loc_key": "nar_m13_line_linked_001",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m13_evt_index_linked",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "The Spine stands and the Crownfall index answers it. The link is durable — the assembly now touches a record that outlives tonight.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 171,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m13_vo_linked_001",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m13_line_linked_002",
   "loc_key": "nar_m13_line_linked_002",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m13_evt_index_linked",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "Witness sites, both of us, separately. Whatever assembles, we watch it onto the public record and add nothing of our own.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 161,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m13_vo_linked_002",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m13_line_complete_observed_001",
   "loc_key": "nar_m13_line_complete_observed_001",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m13_evt_assembly_observed",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "The receipt is complete: paired observation, both witness sites, one public record. The assembly of the missing is witnessed.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 165,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m13_vo_complete_observed_001",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m13_line_complete_bounds_002",
   "loc_key": "nar_m13_line_complete_bounds_002",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m13_evt_assembly_observed",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "We did not learn who they are. We made it impossible to say, in public, that no one saw them. Some nights that is the whole of the work.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 176,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m13_vo_complete_bounds_002",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m13_line_complete_accounts_003",
   "loc_key": "nar_m13_line_complete_accounts_003",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m13_evt_assembly_observed",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "My seven accounts are silent, all together, for the second time I can remember. The first was the quiet we measured. I note the pattern and claim nothing.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 194,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m13_vo_complete_accounts_003",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m13_line_fail_core_001",
   "loc_key": "nar_m13_line_fail_core_001",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m13_evt_mission_failed",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "The command core is gone. The assembly goes unwitnessed on the public record tonight.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 125,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m13_vo_fail_core_001",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m13_line_fail_oruun_002",
   "loc_key": "nar_m13_line_fail_oruun_002",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m13_evt_mission_failed",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "I am cut off. Half the paired observation is no observation; the receipt cannot complete.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 129,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m13_vo_fail_oruun_002",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m13_line_fail_verifier_003",
   "loc_key": "nar_m13_line_fail_verifier_003",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m13_evt_mission_failed",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "The verifier is lost. The receipt requires two, apart, and we are one.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 110,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m13_vo_fail_verifier_003",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m13_line_fail_interface_004",
   "loc_key": "nar_m13_line_fail_interface_004",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m13_evt_mission_failed",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "A public interface is destroyed. A witness without a record is only a memory, and we have learned what happens to those.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 160,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m13_vo_fail_interface_004",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m13_line_fail_terminal_005",
   "loc_key": "nar_m13_line_fail_terminal_005",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m13_evt_mission_failed",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "The engagement has gone terminal. The assembly disperses unrecorded.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 108,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m13_vo_fail_terminal_005",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m13_line_fail_generic_006",
   "loc_key": "nar_m13_line_fail_generic_006",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m13_evt_mission_failed",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "The operation has failed. The missing keep their own count.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 99,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
